# Render map for services/obsidian-livesync/.env (canonical ENV_NAME|folder|item|field).
# Values resolved from Ben's Vaultwarden at deploy time, never committed.
# Folder is case-sensitive: the live folder is `Homelab` (capital H), confirmed
# by operator audit on 2026-10-03 — NOT `homelab` as earlier committed maps assumed.
#
# NOTE: env names are the CouchDB image's authoritative names (COUCHDB_USER /
# COUCHDB_PASSWORD), because deployment is via `docker run --env-file` (the host
# has no compose plugin). The compose scaffold maps these directly too.
COUCHDB_USER|Homelab|obsidian-livesync/couchdb|username
COUCHDB_PASSWORD|Homelab|obsidian-livesync/couchdb|password
LIVESYNC_USER|Homelab|obsidian-livesync/livesync|username
LIVESYNC_PASSWORD|Homelab|obsidian-livesync/livesync|password
